      <title>সাফ জয়ী সন্দীপকে সংবর্ধনা ক্রীড়ামন্ত্রীর, ডার্বির আগে আরও বাড়ল মনোবল</title>
      <link>https://www.aajkaal.in/sports/saff-championship-winner-sandip-mandi-felicitated-by-sports-minister-of-west-bengal-indranil-khan-ahead-of-isl-derby-522165</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.aajkaal.in/sports/saff-championship-winner-sandip-mandi-felicitated-by-sports-minister-of-west-bengal-indranil-khan-ahead-of-isl-derby-522165</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 20:15:00 +0530</pubDate>
